Subject: AF_RXRPC: configure crypto correctly for AF_RXRPC
From: David Howells <dhowells@redhat.com>

AF_RXRPC uses the crypto services, so should depend on or select CRYPTO.

Signed-off-by: David Howells <dhowells@redhat.com>
Cc: Ingo Molnar <mingo@elte.hu>
Cc: Herbert Xu <herbert@gondor.apana.org.au>
Cc: "David S. Miller" <davem@davemloft.net>
Signed-off-by: Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>
---

 net/rxrpc/Kconfig |    1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff -puN net/rxrpc/Kconfig~af_rxrpc-configure-crypto-correctly-for-af_rxrpc net/rxrpc/Kconfig
--- a/net/rxrpc/Kconfig~af_rxrpc-configure-crypto-correctly-for-af_rxrpc
+++ a/net/rxrpc/Kconfig
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 config AF_RXRPC
 	tristate "RxRPC session sockets"
 	depends on INET && EXPERIMENTAL
+	select CRYPTO
 	select KEYS
 	help
 	  Say Y or M here to include support for RxRPC session sockets (just
_

